就业机会并支持社区发展。","reportEdition":"2026-06-01","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpvej11l065tsl0zrvg9kj3a","title":"智谱：建议 A 股发行并在科创板上市","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T15:53:42.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpvej11l065tsl0zrvg9kj3a","https://www.ithome.com/0/958/444.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpvej11l065tsl0zrvg9kj3a","title":"智谱：建议 A 股发行并在科创板上市","originalTitle":"","summary":"智谱计划向中国监管机构申请发行A股并在科创板上市。发行股份数量占发行完成后总股本的2%至8%，预计全部为新股，原股东不发售。本次发行募集资金净额将投资于人工智能通用基座大模型、大模型MaaS一站式服务平台及补充流动资金。此外，公司拟将英文名称由“Knowledge Atlas Technology Joint Stock Company Limited”变更为“Z.AI Co., Ltd.”。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpvej11l065tsl0zrvg9kj3a","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/958/444.htm","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T15:53:42.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-06-01T15:53:42.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"资本与算力军备竞赛升级","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpvej11l065tsl0zrvg9kj3a","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z"}],"sectionLabel":"资本与算力军备竞赛升级","reportSummary":"智谱计划向中国监管机构申请发行A股并在科创板上市。发行股份数量占发行完成后总股本的2%至8%，预计全部为新股，原股东不发售。本次发行募集资金净额将投资于人工智能通用基座大模型、大模型MaaS一站式服务平台及补充流动资金。此外，公司拟将英文名称由“Knowledge Atlas Technology Joint Stock Company Limited”变更为“Z.AI Co., Ltd.”。","reportEdition":"2026-06-01","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpx51hf700otslcksx7ng54n","title":"Claude Code 新增动态工作流功能","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T16:00:00.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpx51hf700otslcksx7ng54n","https://claude.com/blog/a-harness-for-every-task-dynamic-workflows-in-claude-code"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpx51hf700otslcksx7ng54n","title":"Claude Code 新增动态工作流功能","originalTitle":"","summary":"Claude Code 新增动态工作流功能，允许模型在运行时即兴创建和协调多智能体框架来处理复杂任务。该功能通过执行特定的 JavaScript 文件来生成和协调拥有独立上下文窗口的子代理，可解决单一上下文窗口中长时间执行任务可能出现的智能惰性等问题。工作流适用于研究、安全分析、代码审查等场景，通常消耗更多 token，更适合高价值复杂任务，其最佳实践仍在发展中。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpx51hf700otslcksx7ng54n","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/a-harness-for-every-task-dynamic-workflows-in-claude-code","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T16:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-06-01T16:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"智能体从工具进化为平台","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpx51hf700otslcksx7ng54n","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z"}],"sectionLabel":"智能体从工具进化为平台","reportSummary":"Claude Code 新增动态工作流功能，允许模型在运行时即兴创建和协调多智能体框架来处理复杂任务。该功能通过执行特定的 JavaScript 文件来生成和协调拥有独立上下文窗口的子代理，可解决单一上下文窗口中长时间执行任务可能出现的智能惰性等问题。工作流适用于研究、安全分析、代码审查等场景，通常消耗更多 token，更适合高价值复杂任务，其最佳实践仍在发展中。","