下文与原生多模态一体模型","topic":"模型","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T03:39:41.634Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpunu0g50002slbrlfonpoc3","https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-m3"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpunu0g50002slbrlfonpoc3","title":"MiniMax M3：前沿编码、100万token上下文与原生多模态一体模型","originalTitle":"","summary":"MiniMax M3 是一个开源前沿模型，具备先进的编码与AI智能体能力。它支持100万token的超长上下文窗口，并采用名为MSA（MiniMax Sparse Attention）的新型稀疏注意力架构。该架构使模型在100万token上下文下的每token计算成本降至前代的1/20，预填充速度提升9倍以上，解码速度提升15倍以上。在SWE-Bench Pro编码基准上，MiniMax M3得分59.0%，超越GPT-5.5和Gemini 3.1 Pro，性能接近Opus 4.7。该模型可通过MiniMax Code、Token Plan和API服务使用。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpunu0g50002slbrlfonpoc3","originalUrl":"https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-m3","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T03:39:41.634Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-06-01T03:39:41.634Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1iy1rjh","originalSourceName":"MiniMax：Blog（网页）","family":"outlet-1cxhov7","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"开源模型在编码与长上下文上追赶闭源","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpunu0g50002slbrlfonpoc3","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1iy1rjh","name":"MiniMax：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z"}],"sectionLabel":"开源模型在编码与长上下文上追赶闭源","reportSummary":"MiniMax M3 是一个开源前沿模型，具备先进的编码与AI智能体能力。它支持100万token的超长上下文窗口，并采用名为MSA（MiniMax Sparse Attention）的新型稀疏注意力架构。该架构使模型在100万token上下文下的每token计算成本降至前代的1/20，预填充速度提升9倍以上，解码速度提升15倍以上。在SWE-Bench Pro编码基准上，MiniMax M3得分59.0%，超越GPT-5.5和Gemini 3.1 Pro，性能接近Opus 4.7。该模型可通过MiniMax Code、Token Plan和API服务使用。","reportEdition":"2026-06-01","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpvfn56c06fxsl0zknga1ztr","title":"介绍 Mellum2：JetBrains 推出的 12B 混合专家模型","topic":"模型","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T15:45:17.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpvfn56c06fxsl0zknga1ztr","https://huggingface.co/blog/JetBrains/mellum2-launch"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpvfn56c06fxsl0zknga1ztr","title":"介绍 Mellum2：JetBrains 推出的 12B 混合专家模型","originalTitle":"","summary":"Mellum2 是 JetBrains 从头训练的 12B 参数混合专家（MoE）模型，专注于自然语言与代码。每个 token 仅激活 2.5B 参数，推理速度可达同类模型的 2 倍以上，适合高吞吐、低延迟场景。该模型支持路由、RAG、摘要、子智能体及私有部署，以 Apache 2.0 许可证开源。在代码生成、推理、科学和数学基准测试中，Mellum2 与同等规模的开放模型竞争力相当。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpvfn56c06fxsl0zknga1ztr","originalUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/JetBrains/mellum2-launch","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T15:45:17.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-06-01T15:45:17.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-rb89q4","originalSourceName":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","family":"outlet-1ohup8a","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"开源模型在编码与长上下文上追赶闭源","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpvfn56c06fxsl0zknga1ztr","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-rb89q4","name":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z"}],"sectionLabel":"开源模型在编码与长上下文上追赶闭源","reportSummary":"Mellum2 是 JetBrains 从头训练的 12B 参数混合专家（MoE）模型，专注于自然语言与代码。每个 token 仅激活 2.5B 参数，推理速度可达同类模型的 2 